sequenceDiagram
    participant LK as LiveKit Server
    participant AG as EchoMate Agent
    participant MEM as MemoryManager
    participant MR as ModelRouter
    participant MCP as MCPManager
    participant TOOL as ToolRegistry
    participant PERS as PersonalityManager

    LK->>AG: New room connection → entrypoint(ctx)
    AG->>AG: ctx.connect()
    AG->>MEM: init ShortTermMemory(max_tokens=4000)
    MEM->>MEM: init LongTermMemory(chroma_persist_dir)
    AG->>MR: init ModelRouter(timeout=5s, max_fallbacks=3)
    AG->>MCP: init MCPManager + initialize(servers=[])
    AG->>TOOL: init ToolRegistry(mcp_manager)
    AG->>PERS: init PersonalityManager(profile)
    AG->>AG: Load coding context from data/coding_context.json
    AG->>MEM: get_context("user preferences") → memory_context
    AG->>LK: Build Agent(llm, stt, tts, vad, instructions)
    AG->>LK: session.start(agent, room)
    AG->>LK: session.say("Hey! I'm EchoMate...")
    Note over AG: Prints "EchoMate components initialised successfully"